  "title": "Coconut-Cream Cheese Frosting",
  "description": "Sweetened, shredded coconut adds flavor and texture to a luscious butter and cream cheese frosting that&#39;s easy to make and ever so good. Use toasted coconut as a garnish to create an extra elegant cake.",
